<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54391" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταληπ-τός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>seized</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				24.1
			</span></i>; <i>capable of being seized</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				3.24
			</span></i>; <i>liable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανάτῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vand.</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be achieved</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσον . . τὰ
				πράγματα ἐφαίνετο κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τι ἂν ἔσω δέκα ἡμερέων
				ἐμβάλλῃς, πᾶν κ</span>. whatever joint you set within ten
			days, is <i>manageable</i>, i.e. <i>curable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφίᾳ κ. ἅπαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					10.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>capable of being apprehended</i> or <i>grasped</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸ ἦθος ἐξ εἴδους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cleanth.Stoic.
					1.137
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ, αἰσθήσει κ</span>.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Oen.
				4
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λημπτ-</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>certain</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔλογος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πένθος θεόθεν κ</span>. grief
				<i>that falls on us</i> from the gods, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1346
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
